{"title":"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mary typed a six-digit number, but the two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s she typed didn't show. What appeared was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/040d943a7dd825c63b3d642d5a954c95efc72cf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> How many different six-digit numbers could she have typed?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4bac44909d4fba23fd131099c3417a6d1ca2314.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }4 \\qquad \\text{(B) }8 \\qquad \\text{(C) }10 \\qquad \\text{(D) }15 \\qquad \\text{(E) }20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d108b3ce90370786574f2a1d8fd984ecd176a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${5 \\choose 2} + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"70\" height=\"55\" /> since we are choosing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> spots (three in between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e470b7ce7a2f4d0c1ae064d2874ca377693897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and two to the left and right with two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s). We also have to take into account \"double <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s,\" namely, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/9/d69c8bbbc107ad1866a0b09e580fa50f41eed5e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$112002,  211002,  201102,  200112,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"249\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02a5a44cb1cd39860fe74b91da23219420c29d90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200211$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> in our <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> spots.\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd20203b6f2d0b6fb551705d75a1f453da4cb98b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${5 \\choose 2} + 5 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"165\" height=\"55\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can split this into a little bit of casework which is easy to do in our head.\n</p><p>Case 1: The first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is ahead of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e4797950b5e812b65381cbc5fc33ad2db5f57aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\nThen the second <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> places.\n</p><p>Case 2: The first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is below the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e4797950b5e812b65381cbc5fc33ad2db5f57aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\nThen the second <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> places.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/64683f315744c851898c8d65dace1a8aa31b93ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />\n</p><p>This continues as the answer comes to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec82eba39ff3983df44bd07f9e94587ce9f703a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = \\frac{5(6)}{2}=3(5)=15.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"301\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a0daaa384b7af15e3b6a0d0e0702362fb86c928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can just count the cases directly since there are so little.\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a0daaa384b7af15e3b6a0d0e0702362fb86c928.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"72\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can split into steps. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e470b7ce7a2f4d0c1ae064d2874ca377693897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> spaces to place the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and WLOG <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/4673781cae724b9029ffeadf9395d48d465b2462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" /> to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> spaces for next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. As the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s are not distinct, we divide our answer by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/d/afd2f013cf8e010e9ed5caec7d7ce8c02b5cd7ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5*6}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td col